The timeline illustrates the development of seismic attributes in relation to key advances in seismic exploration technology, highlighting the introduction of digital recording, seismic data in color, and various attribute analysis techniques, including complex trace analysis, seismic inversion, and multiattribute analysis, from the 1960s to beyond 2000. Source: gsgpy_70_5_3SO.pdf — page 3

